    "isHTML": true,
    "searchText": "Situation 1 \nYou are an audit senior at Simpson & Wu Limited, and have been discussing one of your audit \nclients, Tangerine plc (Tangerine), with your audit partner Kevin. Tangerine is a listed company \nwhich has an extensive number of commercial and wholesale food stores. Although this is your \nfirst year on the audit, you already know a bit about the client as you inherited some shares in \nthe company from your grandfather last year. \nKevin explains that he has a fantastic relationship with the client, having been the audit partner \nfor the last 6 years. In particular, he has built a strong relationship with the financial director \n(FD) of Tangerine, who helped out Kevin’s wife last year by providing her with a company loan to \nassist her in starting up her own fashion brand. \n ",
