    "isHTML": true,
    "searchText": "Situation 2 \nRegina is the audit manager on the audit of Moira’s Meals Limited (MM), a ready-meal business \nbased in Aberdeen. The CFO, Maisie, has reached out to Regina to request whether one of the \naudit seniors who worked on the MM engagement last year could be placed with MM on a 6-\nmonth secondment to cover the work of a financial accountant who is on maternity leave. \nRegina voices some concerns about this suggestion, as she is not sure any of the audit seniors \nwould want to perform the financial accounting work. However, Maisie offers 6-months of free \nmeals during the period of the secondment to both Regina and any senior who takes on the role, \nwhich makes the arrangement much more appealing. \nLater, when Regina is explaining this to her husband, he says that he has heard of MM before as \nit is one of the companies his pension scheme invests in. \n ",
