    "isHTML": true,
    "searchText": "Situation 4 \nSunshine Properties Limited (Sunshine), a UK based property company, is the largest audit \nclient of Kelly & Whall Limited (K&W). The audit fee for 20X4 is estimated to be £190,000. Last \nyear K&W’s annual fee income was approximately £1.2m, and this is expected to remain steady. \nK&W currently has one premises in Glasgow, but is considering leasing a second premises in \nEdinburgh from Sunshine. Thirza, an audit partner at K&W, has been involved in the lease \ndiscussions, and was delighted to see that draft lease agreement is significantly less expensive \nthan the current office in Glasgow. \nOne of the audit managers on the audit of Sunshine, Darren, approached Thirza to tell her that \nhe has accepted a job offer to join Sunshine as financial controller. \n ",
