    "searchText": "Situation 6 \nThe partners of an audit firm held a meeting to consider how they could generate more income. \nSome of ideas presented included: \n• \nAccepting engagements on a basis whereby a ‘bonus’ fee of 25% is paid if no material \nmisstatements are raised during the audit. \n• \nExpanding the range of non-audit services to include the provision of internal audit \nservices. \n• \nSetting targets for audit managers for selling non-audit services to their audit clients. If \nthey hit a certain target, they will receive commission of 1% of the fee for the non-audit \nservices. ",
