    "isHTML": true,
    "searchText": "Situation 4  \nCars 4 U plc (Cars) is an existing audit client of your audit firm. Cars has performed very strongly in \nthe last year and has recently listed on the London Stock Exchange (LSE). Your firm has historically \nperformed a number of services for Cars in addition to the statutory audit, including some tax advisory \nservices.  \nYour audit firm is planning to complete the audit in a similar timeline to last year and has allocated a \nsimilar team of audit staff to the engagement. You have been discussing Cars with one of the audit \nseniors in the team, who has told you excitedly that they bought shares in Cars as soon as the \ncompany listed. \n ",
