    "isHTML": true,
    "searchText": "Situation 6  \nYour audit firm has been approached to perform the audit of Lucia Lane Limited (Lucia), an \ninternational restaurant chain. The company has a head office in the UK and locations in Europe and \nAsia. Branches in each operating country have full ownership of all processes taking place in that \ncountry. \nManagement at Lucia have asked that you do not contact the previous auditor, and instead have \noffered arrange meetings with your team and all of the branch managers in order for you to learn \nabout the business. In your initial discussion with management, you brought up the audit fee. This \nappeared to surprise them, as they said they believed that audit was a free service.  ",
